-10-29T15:48:08Z","updated_at":"2019-10-29T15:48:08Z","body":"So writing this at the top of `runtime/plugin/netrwPlugin.vim`:\r\n\r\n    au VimEnter * windo let a = 1\r\n    finish\r\n\r\nfixes the issue. But if I write the same autocmd in my vimrc, it does not fix the issue.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/comments/547490000/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"lacygoill","id":8505073,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDUwNzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8505073?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill","html_url":"https://github.com/lacygoill","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/comments/547561470","html_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/11313#issuecomment-547561470","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/11313","id":547561470,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU0NzU2MTQ3MA==","user":{"login":"lacygoill","id":8505073,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDUwNzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8505073?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill","html_url":"https://github.com/lacygoill","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-10-29T18:17:50Z","updated_at":"2019-10-29T18:17:50Z","body":"I bisected the issue to https://github.com/neovim/neovim/commit/2ab70cb55c80b17fb4100dd7f2d056131c02b08b.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/comments/547561470/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"lacygoill","id":8505073,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDUwNzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8505073?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill","html_url":"https://github.com/lacygoill","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/comments/549229687","html_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/11313#issuecomment-549229687","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/11313","id":549229687,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU0OTIyOTY4Nw==","user":{"login":"lacygoill","id":8505073,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDUwNzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8505073?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill","html_url":"https://github.com/lacygoill","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-11-04T05:42:08Z","updated_at":"2019-11-04T05:42:08Z","body":"> Yes, you're right; with -Nu NORC the issue disappears.\r\n\r\nAh no, I was wrong, `-Nu NORC` does not fix the issue; it only fixes it for the top window.\r\n\r\nIf you run the same command as in the OP, and only replace `-Nu NONE` with `-Nu NORC`:\r\n\r\n    $ nvim -Nu NORC +'set wmh=0 | au WinEnter * wincmd _' +'sp|$' <(curl -Ls https://raw.githubusercontent.com/neovim/neovim/master/LICENSE)\r\n\r\nThen, if you press `C-w w` to focus the bottom window, `G` to move on the last line, and finally press `C-w w` twice to focus the top window and come back to the bottom window, the view has – again – been altered.\r\n\r\n![gif](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/8505073/68101428-df52b100-fecd-11e9-838b-1d6525b75280.gif)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n@bfredl I can't fix the issue because I don't know C/lua, but if you need someone to test a patch which tries to fix it, let me know.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/comments/549229687/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"lacygoill","id":8505073,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDUwNzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8505073?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill","html_url":"https://github.com/lacygoill","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lacygoill/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":2766603736,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50Mjc2NjYwMzczNg==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/events/2766603736","actor":{"login":"bfredl","id":1363104,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjMxMDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1363104?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bfredl","html_url":"https:/